            { t = "Rain. I am under the big leaf, upside down, perfectly dry. Come under. Room for one reader.", when = { weather = "rain" } },
            { t = "Blue above, you below, me in the middle. I could not have arranged the colours better.", when = { weather = "clear" } },
            { t = "Winter. I am tucked in the ivy, very still, dreaming in colour. You walked into the dream. Hello.", when = { season = "winter" } },
            { t = "Spring! Everything that was shut is open. Buds. Windows. Me. Hello, hello.", when = { season = "spring" } },
            { t = "Summer. Warm air to stand on. I rode a whole breeze over here just to say hello. Hello. There.", when = { season = "summer" } },
        },
        idle = {
            "I taste with my feet. I landed on your book once. Paper. Dust. A little thumb. Delicious.",
            "I used to be a caterpillar. Stripes. Appetite. No views at all. I think of that fat little thing fondly.",
            "Wings open. Wings shut. Open. Shut. I am turning pages too, you see. Just the one pair.",
            "The tails on my hind wings are for show. Also for birds to snap at, well away from my head. Mostly for show.",
            "Where was I? Fennel. No. Light. No. You. Yes. You, reading. Go on.",
            "My colours are tiny scales, laid like roof tiles. Touch them and they come off as dust. So only look. Look a lot.",
            "A book lying open is a butterfly at rest. Two wings, one spine. I noticed that. Nobody else has.",
            "I keep my tongue rolled up like a watch spring. Unroll, sip, roll. You do something like that with sentences.",
            "I can't remember yesterday very well. Something yellow. Something warm. You were in there, I think, with pages.",
            "Yellow, black, a band of blue, one red spot each side. I did not choose them. I would have chosen exactly them.",
            "Sometimes I fly past the fennel and my feet remember. Only my feet. The rest of me has moved on.",
