            "Day {streak}. I had to ask the snail to keep count. The snail is still getting to the answer.",
            "{streak} days, each with pages. A string of bright beads. I would wear that.",
            "A streak of {streak}. That is a pattern. I know patterns. Yours matches on both sides.",
            "{streak} days running. I ate fennel for about that long once. Look what came of that.",
